-- §SPLIT-DB-RASTER (2026-07-22, VIEWER_FIND_PANEL_ROOM_ACCURACY.md §12) — per-storey walkable
-- bitset for chord-legality (PATH_LEGAL_SEGMENTS.md §G3-REVISED). Built from Terminal_meta.db +
-- Terminal_geo.db (the split-DB mesh pair the live viewer renders), NOT Terminal_extracted.db —
-- the latter is a divergent §24 snapshot with no component_geometries and a mismatched coord frame,
-- which is why the earlier raster attempt resolved 0/174 slabs. Split-DB-aware rebuild resolves
-- 174/174. Regenerate: node scripts/build_storey_walkable_raster.js buildings/Terminal_meta.db \
--   buildings/patches/Terminal_meta.db.sql <out.sql>   (script auto-loads the sibling _geo.db).
-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
